    "probe_text": "Here is the complete, ordered chain for **POST /api/owners** (served by the OfficeFloor YAML pipeline at `src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/api/owners.POST.yml`, not a Spring controller). External path is `POST /petclinic/api/owners`.\n\nSteps run in the order the YAML wires them. I've marked each as a **[validation]** (can reject the request) or a **[side-effect]** (mutation / persistence / I/O). Note: `@RequestBody` is bound *without* `@Valid`, so the DTO's bean-validation annotations do **not** run \u2014 all checks below are manual.\n\n## Gate (before anything)\n0. **[validation] Authorization** \u2014 endpoint-wide `authorize: \"hasRole('OWNER_ADMIN')\"`. Denied \u2192 **403**.\n\n## Idempotency (outside the write transaction)\n1. **[side-effect / branch] `checkIdempotency`** \u2014 if a non-blank `Idempotency-Key` header is already in the in-memory `IdempotencyStore`, short-circuit to a replay: load that owner and respond **200** (skips all validation and the save). Otherwise proceed.\n\n## Validation & normalization (outside the write transaction)\n2. **[side-effect] `normalizeAddress`** \u2014 binds the body once; canonicalizes `addressLine1/2` and `address` (trim, collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand ST/RD/AVE) in place.\n3. **[validation] `validate`** \u2014 firstName, lastName, address, city, telephone must be present/non-blank (collects all missing) \u2192 **400**.\n4. **[validation] `validateRegistrationDate`** \u2014 if present, `registrationDate` must not be in the future \u2192 **400**.\n5. **[validation] `validatePostcode`** \u2014 if present, postcode must match `\\d{4}` and be allowed for the city's region \u2192 **400**.\n6. **[side-effect + validation] `normalizeTelephone`** \u2014 normalize to E.164 (default country +61, 8\u201315 digits); mutates telephone. Unparseable \u2192 **400**.\n7. **[validation] `validateTelephoneLength`** \u2014 national-digit length must match the country code (+61\u21929, +1\u219210) \u2192 *